\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \i All glory, laud, and honour
\par To Thee, Redeemer, King,
\par To whom the lips of children
\par Made sweet hosannas ring!
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thou art the King of Israel,
\par Thou David's royal Son,
\par Who in the Lord's name comest,
\par The King and blessed One.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par All glory, laud, and honour
\par To Thee, Redeemer, King,
\par To whom the lips of children
\par Made sweet hosannas ring!
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par \'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. The company of angels
\par Are praising Thee on high,
\par And mortal men and all things
\par Created make reply.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par All glory, laud, and honour
\par To Thee, Redeemer, King,
\par To whom the lips of children
\par Made sweet hosannas ring!
\par \i0 
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The people of the Hebrews
\par With palms before Thee went;
\par Our praise, and prayer, and anthems
\par Before Thee we present.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par All glory, laud, and honour
\par To Thee, Redeemer, King,
\par To whom the lips of children
\par Made sweet hosannas ring!
\par \i0 
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. To Thee before Thy passion
\par They sang their hymns of praise;
\par To Thee now high exalted
\par Our melody we raise.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par All glory, laud, and honour
\par To Thee, Redeemer, King,
\par To whom the lips of children
\par Made sweet hosannas ring!
\par \i0 
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Thou didst accept their praises;
\par Accept the prayers we bring,
\par Who in all good delightest,
\par Thou good and gracious King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par All glory, laud, and honour
\par To Thee, Redeemer, King,
\par To whom the lips of children
\par Made sweet hosannas ring!
\par \i0 
\par                                       Amen.
\par \i\f1 
